claim.claim-text:
43. A compound selected from the group consisting of: 

N -[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N -(4- methoxybenzyl)acetamide; N1 -[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- 1 -yl)butyl -N -(4- bromobenzyl)acetamide; N1-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- l-yl)butyl •N -(5-bromo-2- hydroxybenzyl)-acetamide; NI-[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- 1 -yl)butyl •N -(4- butoxybenzyl)acetamide; N'-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N -(2- chlorobenzyl)acetamide; N1-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- l -yl)butyl ■N -(2-chloro-5- nitrobenzyl)acetamide; N'-[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- l-yl)butyl -N -(5-chloro-2- nitrobenzyl)acetamide ; N'-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)buty ]-N -2-[(4- chlorophenyl)sulfanyl]benzylacetamide; N'-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N'-(3,5- dichlorobenzyl)acetamide; N1-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N'-(3,4- difluorobenzyl)acetamide; N'-[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl •N -(2,5- dimethoxybenzyl)acetamide; N1 -[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin- 1 -yl)butyl ■N '-(2,3- dimethoxybenzyl)acetamide; N'-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N -(2,4- dimethylbenzyl)acetamide; N1-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl -N -[(5-ethyl-2- furyl )methyl ] acetamide ; N1-[4-(4-amino- lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl •N -(2- furylmethyl)acetamide; N1-[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl ■N -(3- furylmethyl ) acetamide ; 

NJ -[4-(4-amino-lH-imidazo[4,5-c]quinolin-l-yl)butyl]-N -(3- phenylpropyl ) acetamide ;
